00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:01.410
and they didn't want their
brand associated with it.

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:02.940
So I don't know.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.960
I guess Nike is Jesus in
this particular scenario.

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.790
I'm gonna have to figure that one out.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:09.740
That's interesting.

